			<trans-unit id="courses.mail.confirmation_info.ger_locations" xml:space="preserve">
				<source><![CDATA[
<p>You will receive an invoice approximately 4–8 weeks prior to the start of the training.<br>
Upon receipt, the invoice is payable within the stated payment period, and the registration becomes binding.<br>
Cancellation of participation is possible up to two weeks before the start of the training with a full refund.<br>
For cancellations after this deadline (e.g., due to illness), a substitute participant may be nominated. If this is not possible, no refund can be issued.</p>
<p>We reserve the right to cancel a training session in the event of insufficient participant numbers or illness of the instructor.<br>
In such cases, you will be informed immediately and the training fee will be refunded.<br>
We also reserve the right to make changes to the training schedule.</p>
